BT /F2 10 Tf 48 539.3500000000001 Td (5. What is the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 524.8500000000001 Td (The Universal Mind is the life principle of every atom which is in existence.) Tj ET
