BT /F2 10 Tf 48 588.6750000000001 Td (54. How may these conditions be changed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 574.1750000000001 Td (By changing the mechanism by which the Universal is differentiated in form.) Tj ET
