BT /F2 10 Tf 48 516.1250000000001 Td (56. How may it be changed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 501.6250000000001 Td (By the process we call thinking. Thoughts produce brain cells, and these cells respond) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 487.85000000000014 Td (to the corresponding thought in the Universal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 466.07500000000016 Td (57. Of what value is the power of concentration?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 451.57500000000016 Td (It is the very highest personal accomplishment which can be acquired, and the) Tj ET
