BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 351.47500000000025 Td (conditions must be effects; if we can control the cause we can also control the effect.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 329.7000000000003 Td (60. What is changing conditions and multiplying results in the objective world?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 315.2000000000003 Td (Men are learning the basic methods of constructive thinking.) Tj ET
