stream
q 0.969 0.945 0.898 rg 0 0 595 842 re f Q
q 0.024 0.090 0.161 rg 0 770 595 72 re f Q
BT /F2 14 Tf 48 808 Td (UNLEASH YOUR POWER) Tj ET
q 0.71 0.54 0.23 rg 48 795 499 2 re f Q
BT /F2 11 Tf 48 780 Td (THE MASTER KEY SYSTEM - STUDY QUESTIONS & ANSWERS) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 48 742 Td (Part Twenty-Three) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 712 Td (221. What is the first law of success?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 697.5 Td (Service.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 675.725 Td (222. How may we be of the most service?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 661.225 Td (Have an open mind; be interested in the race rather than the goal, in the pursuit rather) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 647.45 Td (than possession.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 625.6750000000001 Td (223. What is the result of a selfish thought?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 611.1750000000001 Td (It contains the germs of dissolution.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 589.4000000000001 Td (224. How will our greatest success be achieved?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 574.9000000000001 Td (By a recognition of the fact that it is just as essential to give as to receive.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 553.1250000000001 Td (225. Why do financiers frequently meet with great success?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 538.6250000000001 Td (Because they do their own thinking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 516.8500000000001 Td (226. Why do the great majority in every country remain the docile and apparently willing) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 502.35000000000014 Td (tools of the few?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 487.85000000000014 Td (Because they let the few do all their thinking for them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 466.07500000000016 Td (227. What is the effect of concentrating upon sorrow and loss?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 451.57500000000016 Td (More sorrow and more loss.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 429.8000000000002 Td (228. What is the effect of concentrating upon gain?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 415.3000000000002 Td (More gain.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 393.5250000000002 Td (229. Is this principle used in the business world?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 379.0250000000002 Td (It is the only principle which is ever used, or ever can be used; there is no other) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 365.2500000000002 Td (principle. The fact that it may be used unconsciously does not alter the situation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 343.47500000000025 Td (230. What is the practical application of this principle?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 328.97500000000025 Td (The fact that success is an effect, not a cause, and if we wish to secure the effect we) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 315.2000000000003 Td (must ascertain the cause, or idea or thought by which the effect is created.) Tj ET
