stream
q 0.969 0.945 0.898 rg 0 0 595 842 re f Q
q 0.024 0.090 0.161 rg 0 770 595 72 re f Q
BT /F2 14 Tf 48 808 Td (UNLEASH YOUR POWER) Tj ET
q 0.71 0.54 0.23 rg 48 795 499 2 re f Q
BT /F2 11 Tf 48 780 Td (THE MASTER KEY SYSTEM - STUDY QUESTIONS & ANSWERS) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 48 742 Td (Part Twenty-Four) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 712 Td (231. Upon what principle does the theory and practice of every system of Metaphysics in) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 697.5 Td (existence depend?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 683 Td (Upon a knowledge of the Truth concerning yourself and the world in which you life.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 661.225 Td (232. What is the "Truth" concerning yourself?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 646.725 Td (The real "I" or ego is spiritual and can therefore never be less than perfect.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 624.95 Td (233. What is the method of destroying any form of error?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 610.45 Td (To absolutely convince yourself of the Truth concerning the condition which you wish to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 596.6750000000001 Td (see manifested.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 574.9000000000001 Td (234. Can we do this for others?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 560.4000000000001 Td (The Universal Mind in which we live and move and have our being is one and indivisible;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 546.6250000000001 Td (it is therefore just as possible to help others as to help ourselves.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 524.8500000000001 Td (235. What is the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 510.35000000000014 Td (The totality of all mind in existence.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 488.57500000000016 Td (236. Where is the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 474.07500000000016 Td (The Universal Mind is omnipresent, it exists everywhere. There is no place where it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 460.3000000000002 Td (not. It is therefore within us. It is "The World within." It is our spirit, our life.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 438.5250000000002 Td (237. What is the nature of the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 424.0250000000002 Td (It is spiritual and consequently creative. It seeks to express itself in form.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 402.2500000000002 Td (238. How may we act on the Universal Mind?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 387.7500000000002 Td (Our ability to think is our ability to act on the Universal Mind and bring it into) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 373.97500000000025 Td (manifestation for the benefit of ourselves or others.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 352.2000000000003 Td (239. What is meant by thinking?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 337.7000000000003 Td (Clear, decisive, calm, deliberate, sustained thought with a definite end in view.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 48 315.9250000000003 Td (240. What will be the result?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 301.4250000000003 Td (You will be able to say, "It is not I that doeth the works, but the 'Father' that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 287.6500000000003 Td (dwelleth within me, He doeth the works." You will come to know that the "Father" is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 273.87500000000034 Td (Universal Mind and that He does really and truly dwell within you, in other words, you) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 260.10000000000036 Td (will come to know that the wonderful promises made in the Bible are fact, not fiction,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 48 246.32500000000036 Td (and can be demonstrated by anyone having sufficient understanding.) Tj ET
